WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.040
The public page starts with an Evidence
answer, not another chatbot.

2
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:07.923
At first it says that no AI action was
presented to this page.

3
00:00:08.203 --> 00:00:10.963
There is no dedicated personal-context
field.

4
00:00:11.243 --> 00:00:14.468
Free text can still disclose personal
details.

5
00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:18.501
A human control and the sixth Site tool
use the same page action.

6
00:00:18.781 --> 00:00:22.436
The page then shows what is supported, its
source and every limit.

7
00:00:22.716 --> 00:00:26.708
The exact Evidence answer digest is
calculated outside the answer.

8
00:00:26.988 --> 00:00:31.061
The Evidence answer separates the page's
evidence from the AI's prose.

9
00:00:31.341 --> 00:00:34.943
It tells people what to check carefully
before relying on an answer.

10
00:00:35.223 --> 00:00:40.067
Dates, amounts, eligibility and legal
steps remain explicit checks.

11
00:00:40.354 --> 00:00:45.054
The comparison contains thirty-six cloud
and thirty-six local observations.

12
00:00:45.334 --> 00:00:49.352
Copilot's Site tools, calls and page
updates were not observable.

13
00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:54.111
The local model exposed tools, but
selection passed only six runs.

14
00:00:54.391 --> 00:00:57.969
Neither result supports a safe-answer or
causal model claim.

15
00:00:58.254 --> 00:01:02.205
A supported host discovers six closed,
bounded Site tools.

16
00:01:02.485 --> 00:01:06.616
The presentation tool accepts only a
validated public record ID.

17
00:01:06.896 --> 00:01:11.264
It changes the page display, but not
storage or government systems.

18
00:01:11.544 --> 00:01:15.060
This receipt names the host and whether a
model selected the calls.

19
00:01:15.354 --> 00:01:19.590
Technical review keeps the search,
provenance and comparison detail.

20
00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:23.379
Legacy evidence links still open this view
and remain shareable.

21
00:01:23.659 --> 00:01:27.513
People can inspect separate evidence
facets without a trust score.

22
00:01:27.793 --> 00:01:32.173
A manual Safari and VoiceOver journey was
recorded for this intended candidate.

23
00:01:32.453 --> 00:01:36.578
It covers both persistent views, the
source and all recorded limits.

24
00:01:36.858 --> 00:01:40.861
The bounded observation is not a claim of
WCAG conformance.

25
00:01:41.141 --> 00:01:44.868
The page hosts no model, profile or
personal chat history.

26
00:01:45.148 --> 00:01:49.747
Compatible hosts can use the same page
tools; support must be observed.

27
00:01:50.027 --> 00:01:52.463
The page makes no official API call.

28
00:01:52.743 --> 00:01:55.544
It does not persist tool arguments or chat
history.

29
00:01:55.824 --> 00:02:00.018
Land Registry remains metadata-only and
legislation stays excluded.
